text = "[center][pulse freq=3.0 color=#ffffff64 ease=-100.0][color=#ff1c18]The coward[/color][/pulse] has fled!

[shake rate=7.0 level=5 connected=0][color=#ff8864]Not exactly  a shocker[/color][/shake]. It  appears that the  mere thought  of  facing  you - or, you know,  any challenge - was simply too  much to  handle.

It's  almost  as if one  had  a sudden, overwhelming  need to  [shake rate=7.0 level=5 connected=0][color=#ff8864]disappear[/color][/shake].

[shake rate=7.0 level=5 connected=0][color=#ff8864]Or could it  be just... [color=#ff1c18]you[/color][/color][/shake]?[/center]"

[node name="NPC_Failure" type="RichTextLabel" parent="Short_Event_Panel/Announce/Dialogue"]
