bbcode_enabled = true
text = "[center][pulse freq=3.0 color=#ffffff64 ease=-100.0][color=#ff1c18]The bastard[/color][/pulse] tried to flee!

[shake rate=7.0 level=5 connected=0][color=#ff8864]You'd think someone would learn by now[/color][/shake].
But no, despite all the chances, they decided to turn back...
The  moment  of escape?  [shake rate=7.0 level=5 connected=0][color=#ff8864]Totally  [color=#ff1c18]missed[/color][/color][/shake].
It’s  almost  as if they were just waiting  for  the  perfect  moment...
[shake rate=7.0 level=5 connected=0][color=#ff8864]Too bad that  moment  never  came[/color][/shake].

[shake rate=7.0 level=5 connected=0][color=#ff8864]Maybe  next  time[/color][/shake], right?[/center]"

